{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey Maria, great chatting with you again! Crazy thing happened since we last talked. I lost my job at the mechanical engineering company. They tanked and it's been really rough. Never saw this coming."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_28-69c82961fbca453ed68fa71d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:30.911618+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "69c82961fbca453ed68fa71d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "69c82961fbca453ed68fa71d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Sorry to hear about your job, John. I can only imagine how tough it must be. How are you holding up?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_28-60d083770e9ddad5a565d475", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:30.934285+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "60d083770e9ddad5a565d475", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "60d083770e9ddad5a565d475", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks for your care, Maria. It's been tough but I'm trying to stay up. I've been looking into some opportunities in the tech industry for a while now. Maybe this is the change I need, you gave me the push!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_28-bf95cae0b2a4486b70bf6145", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:30.949485+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bf95cae0b2a4486b70bf6145", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bf95cae0b2a4486b70bf6145", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Hey John, glad you're looking into other avenues. Any promising leads come up?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_28-d4396e57d17af0b397d567a2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:30.969134+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d4396e57d17af0b397d567a2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d4396e57d17af0b397d567a2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks Maria! I may have found a job at a tech company I like that needs my mechanical skills for their hardware team. It feels different, but I think it's a great opportunity to learn and contribute."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_28-76d081e7f5a39eb99cce40a2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:30.986985+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "76d081e7f5a39eb99cce40a2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "76d081e7f5a39eb99cce40a2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Wow, John, that sounds like the perfect job for you! You're so adaptable, I'm sure you'll do great. Good luck!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_28-6aa542848d46b52947b8dc3e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:31.007495+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6aa542848d46b52947b8dc3e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6aa542848d46b52947b8dc3e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, Maria! I appreciate your support, it really means a lot."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_28-ce1a32abf07ae37172dad372", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:31.031754+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ce1a32abf07ae37172dad372", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ce1a32abf07ae37172dad372", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Hey John, I'm here for you! Staying positive makes a big difference, even in tough times. Yesterday, I took up some community work with my friends from church. It was super rewarding!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_28-c56703afe626701f0b55a9f8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:31.052008+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c56703afe626701f0b55a9f8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c56703afe626701f0b55a9f8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, Maria! That's great. Glad it was rewarding for you."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_28-d88d1c32e7aafa7665145c83", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:31.074625+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d88d1c32e7aafa7665145c83", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d88d1c32e7aafa7665145c83", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Thanks, John! These moments remind me of how important kindness and compassion are. Have you had any volunteer experiences you'd like to share?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_28-4a363e1527cbd3c7580c25a1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:31.086857+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4a363e1527cbd3c7580c25a1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4a363e1527cbd3c7580c25a1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I haven't been able to volunteer much lately, but I definitely care about it. Last year, I helped renovate a rundown community center back home. It took a lot of work, but seeing the impact on the community was so worth it."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_28-7b924bee7fc9a1f563346899", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:31.101980+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7b924bee7fc9a1f563346899", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7b924bee7fc9a1f563346899", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: John, that's great! Must be really satisfying to witness the positive effect it's having on your hometown."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_28-7d3c3798b41bdf67ff14768e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:31.118359+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7d3c3798b41bdf67ff14768e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7d3c3798b41bdf67ff14768e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah! It was really cool to see everyone come together and help out - it's been amazing to see it so busy!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_28-b4e5a019a53c1177849e89e6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:31.138056+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b4e5a019a53c1177849e89e6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b4e5a019a53c1177849e89e6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: Wow, John, awesome job! Keep doing what you're doing - you're making a real difference!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_28-819d4cd715b5388b065e9860", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:31.153206+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "819d4cd715b5388b065e9860", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "819d4cd715b5388b065e9860", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: It's really encouraging to hear that. I'll keep pushing forward and doing my best."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_28-67c6b9881cec3ba9fdcdb578", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:31.171463+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "67c6b9881cec3ba9fdcdb578", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "67c6b9881cec3ba9fdcdb578", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: You got this! You're inspiring and keep making a difference."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_28-b92e2991d9c142b05a0b6c09", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:31.189558+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b92e2991d9c142b05a0b6c09", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b92e2991d9c142b05a0b6c09", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I appreciate it! Your words are really motivating."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_28-7abaa109aadeeb5758b8dc10", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:31.208144+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7abaa109aadeeb5758b8dc10", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7abaa109aadeeb5758b8dc10", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Maria: No worries, John. I'm here to support you. If there's anything else I can do, just let me know."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_28-4d4a472f83b55b8da10620f2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:31.223339+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4d4a472f83b55b8da10620f2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4d4a472f83b55b8da10620f2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, Maria. Your support means a lot to me. If I need anything, I'll be sure to reach out."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-41/session_28-a73fb32f051d043d3b311674", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:34:31.239968+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a73fb32f051d043d3b311674", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a73fb32f051d043d3b311674", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
